message.content:
Sure! Below is a minimal example of an **interactive rotating card** using only HTML & CSS.  
When you hover over the card, it will smoothly rotate around its center.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Rotating Card Demo</title>
<style>
/* ---------- Container (optional) ---------- */
body {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    height:100vh;
    margin:0;
    background:#f0f0f0;
}

/* ---------- Card ---------- */
.card {
    width:260px;          /* card width */
    height:360px;         /* card height */
    perspective:800px;    /* gives depth effect for 3D transform */

    /* optional: center the card inside container */
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
}

.card-inner {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    background:#fff;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:transform .6s ease;   /* smooth rotation */
    transform-style:preserve-3d;     /* keep children in 3D space */
}

/* ---------- Hover effect ---------- */
.card:hover .card-inner {
    transform:rotateY(180deg);       /* rotate 180° around Y axis */
}

/* ---------- Front & Back faces ---------- */
.card-front,
.card-back {
    position:absolute;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    backface-visibility:hidden;      /* hide backside when rotated */
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    font-family:sans-serif;
    font-size:1.5rem;
    color:#333;
    padding:20px;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

.card-front {
    background:#e0f7fa;              /* front face color */
}

.card-back {
    background:#ffebee;              /* back face color */
    transform:rotateY(180deg);       /* start rotated so it's hidden initially */
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-inner">
        <!-- Front side -->
        <div class="card-front">
            <p>Front Side</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Back side -->
        <div class="card-back">
            <p>Back Side</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

### How it works

| Element | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `.card` | Wrapper with `perspective` to give depth to 3D transforms. |
| `.card-inner` | Holds both sides; has `transition` for smooth animation and `transform-style: preserve-3d`. |
| `.card-front`, `.card-back` | Two faces of the card. `backface-visibility:hidden` hides the reverse side when not visible. |
| Hover rule | Rotates `.card-inner` 180° around the Y‑axis. |

Feel free to adjust dimensions, colors, or add more content inside each face. Enjoy your rotating card!
